__any-extended-rafsi__ is a ((Morphology: fu'ivla|fu'ivla)), a __fu'ivla-rafsi__, a  __stressed-fu'ivla-rafsi__, a __brivla-rafsi__ or a __stressed-brivla-rafsi__.

A __fu'ivla-rafsi__ consists of one or more ((Morphology: syllables|unstressed-syllable))s and a ((Morphology: syllables|y-syllable)) and possibly an ((Morphology: consonants|h)), such that it starts with a non-((Morphology: consonants|h)) ((Morphology: syllables|onset)), it doesn't start with a ((Morphology: cmavo|cmavo)), and it is not a y-final __rafsi-string__ or a __slinkujy__.

A __stressed-fu'ivla-rafsi__ consists of any number of ((Morphology: syllables|unstressed-syllable))s (possibly none), one ((Morphology: syllables|stressed-syllable)) and then a ((Morphology: syllables|y-syllable)), such that it starts with a non-((Morphology: consonants|h)) ((Morphology: syllables|onset)), it doesn't start with a ((Morphology: cmavo|cmavo)), and it is not a y-final __rafsi-string__ or a __slinkujy__.

A __brivla-rafsi__ consists of two or more ((Morphology: syllables|unstressed-syllable))s, an ((Morphology: consonants|h))), and a ((Morphology: vowels|y)) and possibly another ((Morphology: consonants|h)), such that it starts with a non-((Morphology: consonants|h)) ((Morphology: syllables|onset)), it doesn't start with a ((Morphology: cmavo|cmavo)), and it is not a __slinkujy__.

A __stressed-brivla-rafsi__ consists of one or more ((Morphology: syllables|unstressed-syllable))s, one ((Morphology: syllables|stressed-syllable)) an ((Morphology: consonants|h))), and a ((Morphology: vowels|y)), such that it starts with a non-((Morphology: consonants|h)) ((Morphology: syllables|onset)), it doesn't start with a ((Morphology: cmavo|cmavo)), and it is not a __slinkujy__.

A __slinkujy__ is a  ((Morphology: consonants|consonant)) followed by a y-final __rafsi-string__

A y-final __rafsi-string__ consists of any number of ((Morphology: rafsi|y-less-rafsi)) (possibly none) followed by a  ((Morphology: rafsi|y-rafsi)), a ((Morphology: rafsi|stressed-y-rafsi)), a ((Morphology: rafsi|stressed-y-less-rafsi)) plus an ((Morphology: consonants|initial-pair)) and a ((Morphology: vowels|y)), or just an ((Morphology: consonants|initial-pair)) and a ((Morphology: vowels|y)).


